+; --- M5Stack PaperDIY — ESP32-S3 N16R8, ED047TC1 raw parallel, 2 buttons ------
+; Same panel/bus as PaperS3 but no touch/RTC/IMU, two GPIO buttons and an M5PM1
+; PMIC. Board support lives in freeink-sdk/libs/hardware/BoardPaperDiy.
+;   pio run -e paperdiy -t upload
